Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:03.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（早上4点30分）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't understand. Me gonads, you ovaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不懂 我是男的 你是女的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That reminds me. We are out of tampons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这倒提醒了我 卫生棉条用完了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:13.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're parading to the bathroom in your underwear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:13.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你穿着内衣闯进浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.25,0:01:14.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}when I'm naked in the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.25,0:01:14.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我正裸体在淋浴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:15.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you add it to your list. please?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:15.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麻烦你列入清单
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:17.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Tampons!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:17.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么？ - 卫生棉条！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.54,0:01:19.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To the list. It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.54,0:01:19.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}列入购物清单 换你采买了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:23.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am a man! I don't buy girl products!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:23.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是男人！我不买女性卫生用品！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want you walking in while I'm in the shower,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不要你在我淋浴时闯进来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:27.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I don't want to see you in your underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:27.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也不想看到你只穿内衣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.79,0:01:29.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't bother me, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.79,0:01:30.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没关系 好吗？ 尽管看只穿内衣的我 乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.21,0:01:30.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at me in my underwear, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:32.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take your time. It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:32.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢慢看 没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.25,0:01:38.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are the first person they see in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.25,0:01:38.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们是病患一早最先见到的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:40.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You say please. You say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:42.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以要说“请、谢谢” 把他们叫醒时要道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:42.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You apologize for waking them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:45.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You make them feel good about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:46.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让病患对你们有好印象 这为何很重要？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:46.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why is that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:49.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}'cause then they'll talk to you and tell you what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:49.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他们会跟你们聊天 告诉你们哪里不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:51.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why is that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:51.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这为何很重要呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.21,0:01:54.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because then you can tell your attending what they need to know during rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.21,0:01:54.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为这样你们就能告诉主治医师 巡房时需要知道的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.79,0:01:56.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And why is that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.79,0:01:56.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这为何很重要？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.00,0:01:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because if you make your resident look bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.00,0:01:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为若你们让住院医师难堪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:02.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}she'll torture you until you beg for your mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:02.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她会把你们折磨到哭着找妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:07.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now get out there. I want pre-rounds done by 5:30 am.
