Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:13.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice tat.
