Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:03:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 我吃了剩下的烤奶酪三明治 好奇心满足了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:02.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's sad. It's pathetic.
