Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:17.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就是像姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just like sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is he prepped?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:34.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think they're doing it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:34.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得他们正在做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:35.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:35.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:37.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's having a prostate biopsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:37.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他要做前列腺活检检查
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:39.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Trust me. If you'd been in there, you'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:39.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相信我 若你做过这种手术 就不会这么无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:46.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, Mr. Humphrey. We're gonna get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:46.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 杭佛瑞先生 我们要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:53.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get her out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:53.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}叫她出去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:55.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want her out of here! Just get her out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:55.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要她出去！快叫她出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:58.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just you go! Now! Just go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你给我出去！快点！马上出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, relax! Relax, Mr. Humphrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 别激动！杭佛瑞先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Will he be able to see again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他能恢复视力吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.75,0:12:09.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We won't know until the nails come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.75,0:12:09.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要等拔除钉子后才会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:12.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did he tell you he takes photos?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:12.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他提过他会拍照吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:15.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Beautiful photos. It's his hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:15.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很美的照片 那是他的嗜好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just got him a new digital camera, and now he can't stop, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚买给他一台新的数码相机 他拿到后拍个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.00,0:12:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He always has it out, always taking pictures of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.00,0:12:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他总是到处拍 总是要替我拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:25.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Jorge said he's been having headaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:25.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}荷黑说他最近会头痛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:28.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you tell me about them? Have they been recent?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能告诉我头痛的事吗？ 是最近开始的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:30.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:33.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not sure. Maybe the last couple of months.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:33.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不确定 大概是几个月前开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you seen him experience any dizziness or disorientation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是否看到过他晕眩或迷失方向？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, yes, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有 我看到过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want to tell me what that was all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要告诉我那是怎么回事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:57.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's probably just crazy or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:57.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他可能只是疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.25,0:13:07.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bethany Whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.25,0:13:07.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝瑟妮私语
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:09.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Bethany Whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:09.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么？ - 贝瑟妮私语
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.67,0:13:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did a new Bethany Whisper lingerie ad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.67,0:13:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我给贝瑟妮私语拍了新的内衣广告
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He saw it in a magazine. - You got time to pose for magazines?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他在杂志上看到了 - 你还有空给杂志当模特？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:16.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, the shoot was last year. It just came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:16.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是 那是去年拍的 最近才发布
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:19.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So because he saw you in a thong... - It wasn't a thong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:19.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 所以他看到你穿丁字裤... - 那不是丁字裤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:20.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're hiding in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:20.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你就躲在走廊上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.83,0:13:23.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just think it might be easier if you assign another intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.83,0:13:23.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你派另一位实习医生负责 会比较轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:26.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Easy is not in your job description. You are a doctor. He is a patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:26.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}行医一点也不轻松 你是医生 他是病人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.75,0:13:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's your patient. Biopsy these.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.75,0:13:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是你的病人 检查这些活检
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:32.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If they come back positive, I expect to see you in surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:32.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若结果是阳性 我要在手术室见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:36.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you're on this. You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:36.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你的工作 懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.29,0:13:48.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Vertiginous or light-headedness? - Light-headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.29,0:13:48.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是眩晕还是头昏眼花？ - 头昏眼花
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.75,0:13:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sometimes he'd have to brace himself to get out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.75,0:13:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时他必须扶着东西才能起床
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:53.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could be a million things. Simple orthostasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:53.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可能性很多 也许只是起身时血压低
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:54.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:54.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:56.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What made him fall with a nail gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:56.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他为何会拿着钉枪摔落楼梯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He said he tripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说被绊倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just because you hear hoofbeats, don't assume zebras.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别听到一点消息 就过度揣测
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:03.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Something caused him to lose consciousness and fall down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:03.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他因为某个原因失去意识 摔落楼梯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He could have a tumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他可能有脑瘤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:07.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I have no idea why this guy's still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:07.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我不知道这家伙为何仍活着
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:09.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}let alone moving and talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:09.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更别提他能移动说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:11.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not a clue. Let's just get him through this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:11.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全想不通 我们先让他撑过这关
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}before we start digging around for something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再开始探究其他病症吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:20.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Shepherd. Twenty-three cases? - One was attempted suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:20.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我是薛波 有23例？ - 有一例是试图自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. That doesn't count. Talk to me about procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不算 告诉我手术过程
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Biggest problems are bleeding and infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最大的问题是出血和感染
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Odds improved with shorter surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}必须缩短手术时间来避免
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bottom line was get them out quickly and watch for bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:29.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关键是要快速取出钉子 注意出血
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got it. Other words, I'm on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}了解 换句话说 只能靠我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.38,0:14:41.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.38,0:14:41.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.92,0:14:43.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dude, I don't need an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.92,0:14:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄 我不需要人护送
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:45.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:45.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你先走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:47.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:47.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:52.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:52.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好样的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:14:56.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Bethany Whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:14:56.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝瑟妮私语医生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She had this thing for red when we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们刚认识时 她很爱红色
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:20.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Red car, red dresses, red hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:20.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}红色的车、红色裙装、红色帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Personally, I hated the color.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我自己则很讨厌红色
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:25.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Too obvious, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:25.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太显眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:28.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But a couple years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:28.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但几年前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:30.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I took her up to the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:30.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我带她去山上玩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:33.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She was in a red dress,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:33.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她穿着红色裙装
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:36.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and there was this field of red...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:36.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那里有一片红色的田地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}poppies, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该是罂粟花田
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And she jumped out of the car
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她冲下车
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and ran into them
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跑进花田里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and started laughing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开怀大笑...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}laughing at all the red.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在一片红色中灿笑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:59.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The good news is it hasn't spread from his prostate to his lymph nodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:59.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好消息是还没从淋巴结扩散到前列腺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:03.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With a radical prostatectomy, we could probably get it all.
