Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.75,0:24:04.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.75,0:24:04.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就这么做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.67,0:24:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm taking the elevator. You take the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.67,0:24:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我搭电梯 你走楼梯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.08,0:24:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was going to, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.08,0:24:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本来就打算那样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.00,0:24:10.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.00,0:24:10.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.38,0:24:11.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.38,0:24:11.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.62,0:24:13.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.62,0:24:13.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.67,0:24:19.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.67,0:24:19.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}笑什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.96,0:24:31.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't wake a patient like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.96,0:24:31.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能这样叫醒病人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.46,0:24:34.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do I have to do to get through to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.46,0:24:34.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要怎么说你才懂？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.96,0:24:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cut me some slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.96,0:24:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放过我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.17,0:24:38.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was on call last night. I didn't get much sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.17,0:24:38.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我昨晚值班 没怎么睡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.79,0:24:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stop whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.79,0:24:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别再抱怨了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd rather be here, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你宁愿待在医院 你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.42,0:24:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What you got waiting for you at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.42,0:24:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你家里有什么在等你？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.54,0:24:47.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.54,0:24:47.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}男朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.50,0:24:49.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.50,0:24:49.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.33,0:24:51.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.33,0:24:51.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.17,0:24:53.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.17,0:24:53.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.58,0:24:55.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A pet? Family?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.58,0:24:55.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宠物？家人？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一张床
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.79,0:25:02.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We got plenty of beds here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.79,0:25:02.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里有很多床
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.62,0:25:05.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't feel sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.62,0:25:05.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会为你感到难过
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:08.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is who we are. This is our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:08.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是我们的工作、我们的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.12,0:25:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You tell her, Dr. Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.12,0:25:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说她几句 柏克医生
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.46,0:25:21.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.46,0:25:21.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能跟你谈一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.17,0:25:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.17,0:25:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.96,0:25:25.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Let's go. - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.96,0:25:25.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 快点 - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.00,0:25:29.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.00,0:25:29.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让一让 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.21,0:25:32.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.21,0:25:32.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治 别挡我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.83,0:25:39.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.83,0:25:39.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.38,0:25:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have Bethany Whisper in our locker room.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.38,0:25:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝瑟妮私语女郎莅临我们的更衣室
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.46,0:25:48.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, boy, I guess they do
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.46,0:25:50.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 看来他们真的遮掉了你的纹身
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.29,0:25:50.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}airbrush out the tattoo, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.67,0:25:59.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want to see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.67,0:25:59.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.58,0:26:01.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You really want to see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.58,0:26:01.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的想看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.75,0:26:03.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.75,0:26:03.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.67,0:26:06.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's look at that tattoo up close and personal, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.67,0:26:06.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来仔细看一看那个纹身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.75,0:26:09.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what are these? Oh, my God! Breasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.75,0:26:09.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是什么？天啊！是胸部！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.54,0:26:12.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How does anybody practice medicine hauling these things around?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.54,0:26:12.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拖着这对东西要怎么行医啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.92,0:26:14.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what do we got back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.92,0:26:14.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这后面是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.96,0:26:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's see if I remember my anatomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.96,0:26:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来看我是否还记得解剖学
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.71,0:26:20.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Glutes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.71,0:26:20.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}臀肌 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.25,0:26:22.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's study them, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.25,0:26:22.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来研究一番 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.21,0:26:24.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gather around and check out the booty
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.21,0:26:24.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快靠近点看 就是这对屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.25,0:26:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that put Izzie Stevens through med school.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.25,0:26:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让伊兹史蒂文斯拿到医科文凭
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.29,0:26:29.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you had enough or should I continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.29,0:26:29.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看够了吗？还是要继续？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I have a few more very interesting tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我还有几个很有趣的纹身
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.88,0:26:37.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want to call me Dr. Model?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.88,0:26:37.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想叫我模特医生？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.17,0:26:40.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.17,0:26:40.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尽管叫
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.50,0:26:43.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just remember that while you're sitting on 200 grand of student loans...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.50,0:26:43.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但别忘记 当你还扛着20万美金学生贷款时...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.88,0:26:46.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm out of debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.88,0:26:46.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已无债一身轻
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.79,0:26:51.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'll take them down. - Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.79,0:26:51.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我把它们撕掉 - 不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.83,0:26:54.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.83,0:26:54.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}闪开！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.04,0:27:02.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you tell me what you had for breakfast on Monday?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.04,0:27:02.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你记得周一吃的什么早餐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.58,0:27:03.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cheese omelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.58,0:27:03.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}奶酪煎蛋卷
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.71,0:27:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And on Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.71,0:27:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}周日也是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.25,0:27:08.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And on Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.25,0:27:08.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}周六也是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.21,0:27:10.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And on Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.21,0:27:10.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}周五也是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:15.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sona gets up every morning and makes me a cheese omelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:15.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}索娜每天早上都做奶酪煎蛋卷给我吃
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.29,0:27:17.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the only thing he likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.29,0:27:17.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他只喜欢吃那个
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.83,0:27:19.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the only thing you know how to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.83,0:27:19.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是你只会做那个才对
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.83,0:27:21.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, things look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.83,0:27:21.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}情况看起来很好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.96,0:27:25.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I need Jorge to get an MRI this morning to check for residual bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.96,0:27:25.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我需要荷黑今早接受核磁共振检查 看是否有残余出血
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.08,0:27:39.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is who I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.08,0:27:39.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是以前的我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.17,0:27:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It has nothing to do with who I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.17,0:27:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}与现在的我毫无关联
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.54,0:27:43.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a physician, a surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.54,0:27:43.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是医生 外科医生
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.46,0:27:47.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I am just as qualified as any other intern on this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.46,0:27:47.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我如同院内任何一位实习医生 具备医生资格
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.21,0:27:50.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, you're just gonna have to get over your chauvinist crap
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.21,0:27:50.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你得忘掉那些沙文主义的歪理
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.29,0:27:52.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and allow me to do my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.29,0:27:52.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我做好我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.79,0:27:58.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure you're a very good doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.79,0:27:58.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我确信你是位非常好的医生
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.67,0:28:01.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then what is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.67,0:28:01.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你到底有什么问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.50,0:28:03.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.50,0:28:03.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.04,0:28:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I fantasized about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.04,0:28:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我曾以你为幻想对象...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.96,0:28:12.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}about the woman in this photo, whoever she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.96,0:28:12.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}幻想照片里的这个女人 无论她是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.42,0:28:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not proud of it, but it's a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.42,0:28:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不以此为荣 但这是事实
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.29,0:28:26.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you know what they're gonna do to me today?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.29,0:28:26.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道他们今天要对我做什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.92,0:28:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.92,0:28:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得了癌症
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.29,0:28:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And they're gonna lift up my legs and expose me to the world
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.29,0:28:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们将抬起我的双腿 曝露在大家面前
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.17,0:28:37.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and cut out my prostate and my nerves,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.17,0:28:37.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}切除我的前列腺和神经
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.50,0:28:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}effectively neuter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.50,0:28:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等于将我去势
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.50,0:28:45.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, is it so hard to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.50,0:28:45.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以应该不难理解
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.58,0:28:49.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that I don't want the woman who's in that photo to witness...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.58,0:28:49.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想让照片里的那个女人 亲眼看到...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.62,0:28:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}my emasculation?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.62,0:28:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的去势手术吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.46,0:29:04.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Have you seen her overnight labs? - I have.
