Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.83,0:39:15.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to save the nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.83,0:39:15.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得保留这些神经
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.79,0:39:17.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - The nerves, you have to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.79,0:39:17.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么？ - 你得保留神经
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.21,0:39:18.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Stevens, I can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.21,0:39:18.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史蒂文斯医生 别插手
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.38,0:39:19.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You told me the most important thing
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.38,0:39:19.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说过最重要的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.58,0:39:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}is giving the patient what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.58,0:39:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}满足病人的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.04,0:39:22.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What Humphrey wants is his erection.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.04,0:39:22.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}杭佛瑞要的是能勃起
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.54,0:39:25.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's yours. You get her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.54,0:39:25.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是你的实习生 你叫她出去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.96,0:39:27.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can't do that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.96,0:39:27.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}办不到 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.33,0:39:29.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know how these young puppies are.
