Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.75,0:39:33.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to tell Richard about both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.75,0:39:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会向理查德举报你们俩
